<title>GERMANY: German inland gas easier, touch more business.</title>
<headline>German inland gas easier, touch more business.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DLR/DM=1.6893)   DM/100 LTRS     DLRS/100 LTRS   LAST DM</p>
<p> HAMBURG	     33.50/33.90     19.83/20.07   33.60/34.00</p>
<p> BREMEN		33.50/33.90     19.83/20.07   33.60/34.00</p>
<p> DUISBURG	    33.30/33.60     19.71/19.89   33.50/33.90</p>
<p> FRANKFURT	   33.80/34.20     20.01/20.25   33.90/34.30</p>
<p> KARLSRUHE	   33.80/34.30     20.01/20.25   33.70/34.20</p>
<p> INGOLSTADT	  34.70/35.30     20.96/21.19   34.40/35.00</p>
<p>German inland gas oil was narrowly weaker on Wednesday. business was slightly improved in response to rising prices on Tuesday which encouraged some buyers to think the market had bottomed out. Fundamental demand remsin thin.</p>
</text>
